{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>何文田今日（30日）發生懷疑虐畜案。早上11時06分，警方接獲窩打老道112號住戶報案，指懷疑其12歲松鼠狗曾遭外傭不恰當對待。</p><p>警員接報到場，發現松鼠狗左眼受傷，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「殘酷對待動物」拘捕報案人的44歲印尼籍外傭，她現正被扣留調查。案件交由九龍城警區刑事支援隊跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"案件交由九龍城警區刑事支援隊跟進。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4686405/org/c17118786da23f9bc325012abb51e515.jpg/kWzPoYlBH5RAcIhXKI70CP4oH4zBMYObP_xmgD_8ZoA\"/><figcaption>案件交由九龍城警區刑事支援隊跟進。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:54.874202+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:08:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:21.647446+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:28.225482+00:00","content_hash":"e52a2dd89aa9e6285a846afffc1c3efc3aaa15b4530bf5438ddd77b86a87ccb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}